- Print Shop - Mitch - Avery Dennison Certified Installer", "tag": ""}, {"src": "/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Heating-the-vinyl-to-apply-it-on-the-car.jpg", "title": "Vinyl Wrap Toronto - Vehicle Wrap In Toronto - Heating the vinyl to apply it on the car", "tag": ""}, {"src": "/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Range-Rover-Wrap-Full-Car-Wrap.jpg", "title": "Vinyl Wrap Toronto - Vehicle Wrap In Toronto - Range Rover Wrap - Full Car Wrap", "tag": ""}, {"src": "/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Vinyl-Wrap-Toronto-Vehicle-Wrap-In-Toronto-Range-Rover-Wrap-Full-Vehicle-Wrap.webp", "title": "Vinyl Wrap Toronto - Vehicle Wrap In Toronto - Range Rover Wrap - Full Vehicle Wrap", "tag": "", "alt": "Vinyl Wrap Toronto - Vehicle Wrap In Toronto - Range Rover Wrap - Full Vehicle Wrap"}, {"src": "/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Land-Rover-Range-Rover-Sport-2018-Full-Personal-1.jpg", "title": "Land Rover - Range Rover - Sport - 2018 - Full - Personal - Vinyl Wrap Toronto", "tag": ""}]}], "padding": "0px 0px 20px 0px", "maxWidth": null, "background": "#FFFFFF"}, {"id": "b45e69d", "blocks": [{"type": "columns", "cols": [{"width": 50, "blocks": [{"type": "text", "html": "<h4>Range Rover Full Car Wrap</h4> <p>This wrap was done using Satin Black Vinyl Wrap and we used Avery Dennison Supreme Wrapping Film This was a full car wrap.<br/>We printed and applied the vinyl in-house. Below are photos to show the process of how we apply the vinyl to the car. We care about your wrap and so we make sure to cover even the areas where you cannot see. Here at <a href=\"https://g.page/vinylwraptoronto?share\">Vinyl Wrap Toronto</a>, we like to show off our capable crew applying the wrap perfectly to your vehicle. We usually use 3M and Avery Dennison which are considered to be the best on the market right now.<br/>For this Range Rover, we used Avery Dennison Supreme Wrapping Film to complete the look the client was after. This satin black vinyl was carefully placed by our installers, who in our opinion, did a great job applying it.</p> <p>Facebook Page: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/vinylwraptoronto\">https://www.facebook.com/vinylwraptoronto</a></p> <p>Instagram Page: <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/vinylwraptoronto\">https://www.instagram.com/vinylwraptoronto</a></p> <p>Want to get the design that you always wanted on your car or wrap your vehicle for commercial use? Check our <a href=\"/object-and-equipment-wrap-toronto/\">equipment wrap pages</a> for more ideas.</p> <p>We use only 3M &amp; Avery Dennison as they are considered premium materials.<br/>Give us a call today at <a href=\"tel:416-746-1381\">416-746-1381</a> or visit our website: <a href=\"/\">https://www.vinylwraptoronto.com</a></p> <p>To check more full car wraps, click <a href=\"/full-car-wrap-toronto/\">here</a>.</p>", "style": "text-align:start;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5em;font-weight:300"}, {"type": "postnav", "prev": {"href": "/wall-wrap-toronto/", "text": "Prev Previous Wall Wrap Toronto | Toronto Wall Graphics"}, "next": {"href": "/motorcycle-tank-wrap/", "text": "Next Motorcycle Tank Wrap – Custom Vehicle Graphics in GTA Next"}}]}, {"width": 50, "blocks": [{"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Limited Time Offer", "href": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-size:22px;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:500"}, {"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Get a Standard 3M or Avery Manufactured Full Wrap for a Tesla at", "href": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4em;color:var( --e-global-color-a8178e9 );font-weight:500"}, {"type": "heading", "level": 3, "text": "$4,500 $3,500", "href": null, "style": null}, {"type": "button", "text": "Claim Now", "href": "#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjIyMDU1IiwidG9nZ2xlIjpmYWxzZX0%3D", "style": "text-align:center;font-size:14px;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:500;text-transform:uppercase"}, {"type": "toc", "title": "Table of Contents"}, {"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Share This Post", "href": null, "sty